  "question": {
    "text": "A particle describes a horizontal circle in a conical funnel, whose inner surface is smooth, with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. What is the height (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>) of the plane of the circle from the vertex of the funnel?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0141_56f39416e28d.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 195px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br />Dividing above equations<br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>"
  }
}